# Apple IIgs ROM toolbox function entry points, read from the ROM image by tools/a2rail/romfpt.py
# source TPT $FE012F, 33 tool sets, 526 entries. A PC between two entries is named after the
# preceding entry: right for a function body, wrong for a shared helper (use a dispatcher trap).
# Each address is the table entry plus one: the entry is the function minus one, for the RTL.
